# ── Awakeden site previews (committed for Netlify; production PNGs stay gitignored) ──
!_website/assets/previews/
!_website/assets/previews/**

# ── Awakeden internal docs/logs — never commit/deploy (Netlify publish dir is _website/.) ──
_website/_independent_review/
_website/COPY_REWRITE.md

# ── Media (per repo policy — code/data/docs only, no media) ────
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.zip

# Re-allow committed Awakeden site previews + share image (MUST come after the media ignores) ──
!_website/assets/previews/
!_website/assets/previews/**
